{"lyrics":"[00:00.00] [Instrumental Intro]\n[Intro: Ally Lotti]\n[00:23.86] Hahaha\n[00:24.12] (Hahahaha, Nick, you're stupid)\n[Chorus]\n[00:26.52] My heart's racin' even on vacation (Cool)\n[00:29.44] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[00:32.38] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[00:35.90] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy\n[00:39.64] My heart's racin' even on vacation (Cool)\n[00:41.70] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[00:45.54] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[00:49.06] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy\n[Verse 1]\n[00:53.86] You know my flaws (Flaws)\n[00:56.30] You know all my fuck-ups and past mistakes (Uh-huh, mistakes)\n[01:00.44] Our love is law, the only law I would never break (Break)\n[01:07.24] I'll fight for us, through bloody nights and through bloody days\n[01:13.30] Uh, you hate it when my dragon gets out the cage\n[01:16.06] All my demons unchained, but you still don't run away\n[Bridge]\n[01:19.00] I thought I'd make this song for you\n[01:21.94] To sing along and smile\n[01:24.36] I would kill anything, anyone, everyone for you\n[01:28.46] I would slay 'em all down\n[Chorus]\n[01:29.82] My heart's racin' even on vacation (Cool)\n[01:34.30] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[01:37.88] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[01:41.64] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy\n[01:44.82] My heart's racin' even on vacation (Cool)\n[01:48.34] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[01:51.30] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[01:54.80] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy\n[Verse 2]\n[01:59.54] While my brain rots\n[02:02.02] Mental pictures of you fall out of my skull\n[02:06.12] No, I can't stop\n[02:08.50] Obsessing over you, I no longer have my control\n[02:12.96] You really helped me get in my zone\n[02:16.22] Forever next to you like Mike Jones\n[02:19.74] We should take the long way home\n[02:22.38] Let's run away and take the wrong way home\n[Bridge]\n[02:24.76] Thought I'd make this song for you\n[02:27.08] Our love is young and wild\n[02:29.96] I'll kill anything, anyone, everyone for you\n[02:34.48] Blow 'em all down, like click-clack-bow\n[Chorus]\n[02:37.10] My heart's racin' even on vacation\n[02:40.02] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[02:42.96] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[02:46.48] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy\n[02:50.22] My heart's racin' even on vacation\n[02:52.28] But I'm tryna focus on you, my baby\n[02:56.12] I know my past heartbreak, and chances, I'll take them\n[02:59.64] It's not hard to tell that you drive me crazy","words":[[22.88,23.18,"[Intro:"],[23.3,23.46,"Ally"],[23.6,23.78,"Lotti]"],[23.86,24.0,"Hahaha"],[24.12,24.7,"(Hahahaha,"],[24.76,24.96,"Nick,"],[25.06,25.22,"you're"],[25.28,25.96,"stupid)"],[26.18,26.46,"[Chorus]"],[26.52,26.62,"My"],[26.76,27.02,"heart's"],[27.1,27.74,"racin'"],[27.78,28.1,"even"],[28.18,28.46,"on"],[28.52,29.04,"vacation"],[29.12,29.4,"(Cool)"],[29.44,29.52,"But"],[29.66,29.8,"I'm"],[29.86,30.06,"tryna"],[30.18,30.8,"focus"],[30.92,31.12,"on"],[31.24,31.46,"you,"],[31.62,31.84,"my"],[32.02,32.34,"baby"],[32.38,32.38,"I"],[32.42,32.6,"know"],[32.8,32.82,"my"],[32.86,33.26,"past"],[33.3,34.08,"heartbreak,"],[34.16,34.24,"and"],[34.3,35.06,"chances,"],[35.18,35.26,"I'll"],[35.32,35.7,"take"],[35.76,35.84,"them"],[35.9,36.14,"It's"],[36.32,36.38,"not"],[36.44,36.52,"hard"],[36.56,36.64,"to"],[36.74,37.04,"tell"],[37.16,37.32,"that"],[37.4,37.48,"you"],[37.74,38.16,"drive"],[38.2,38.4,"me"],[38.56,39.06,"crazy"],[39.64,39.76,"My"],[40.04,40.18,"heart's"],[40.26,40.88,"racin'"],[40.96,41.16,"even"],[41.22,41.26,"on"],[41.32,41.46,"vacation"],[41.5,41.62,"(Cool)"],[41.7,41.8,"But"],[42.12,42.18,"I'm"],[42.54,43.22,"tryna"],[43.34,43.94,"focus"],[44.06,44.28,"on"],[44.4,44.62,"you,"],[44.76,44.98,"my"],[45.18,45.5,"baby"],[45.54,45.54,"I"],[45.58,45.76,"know"],[45.94,45.96,"my"],[4